99
00:16:00,046 --> 00:16:08,548
我们还测试了它在不同距离（合理的阅读距离）以及不同朝向下的表现。
And also we test how it works with different distance with and reasonable reading distance, and also the orientations.

100
00:16:09,166 --> 00:16:20,448
从准确率来看，我们可以看到即使在 30 度角时，
我们的 SpecEye 依然能提供稳定的屏幕检测性能。
So from the accuracy and we can see until 30 degrees, and our spec eye still can provide a stable screen detection performance.

101
00:16:20,942 --> 00:16:29,444
