00:16:57,870 --> 00:17:02,084
最后，我想讨论一下局限性。
And the very last, way I would like to discuss the limitations.

108
00:17:02,576 --> 00:17:06,736
隐私在屏幕检测中非常重要。
So privacy is very important in the screen detection.

109
00:17:06,976 --> 00:17:16,932
为了实现这一目标，我们利用了极简传感器，仅获取屏幕检测所需的最小信息。
And in order to meet that goal, we have been utilized the minimal sensors,
provide and acquire the minimal information for the screen's polar detection.

110
00:17:17,390 --> 00:17:21,954
