However, we are not sure whether those minimal really means private.

111
00:17:22,736 --> 00:17:33,476
例如，在压缩传感的例子中，它通过少量样本改进了单像素相机，但仍然有可能重建图像。
For example, in the example of compressed sensing, it has improved a single pixel camera with a few samples,
it is still possible to reconstruct a picture.

112
00:17:33,936 --> 00:17:39,376
因此，目前尚不清楚我们使用的基于 PN 结的传感器
So it is unknown whether we utilize a pin junction-based sensor.

113
00:17:39,726 --> 00:17:47,940
是否仍可能被黑客或恶意用户用来重建屏幕场景。
Still could the hackers or malicious users cannot reconstruct the scene of the screen.

114
00:17:48,526 --> 00:17:58,308
第二个可能的局限性是，未来我们的屏幕技术可能会有不同的光源，比如量子照明。
