00:18:17,870 --> 00:18:22,976
SpecEye 是一个用于暴露检测的可穿戴系统。
So spec eye is a wearable system for the exposure detection.

118
00:18:23,182 --> 00:18:27,364
它是普及的、低成本的，并且保护隐私。
It is pervasive, it is low cost, and privacy preserving.

119
00:18:27,886 --> 00:18:39,492
我们这里利用的技术是 PN 结和光伏效应建模，它可以实现很高的检测准确率。
And the technology here we utilize is the p in junction and the photovoltaic effect modeling,
and which can achieve a high detection accuracy.

